<BaseLayout title="Feature Requests — TotalRecalls" description="Suggest improvements to TotalRecalls.">
  <h1>Feature Requests</h1>
  <p>We are constantly improving TotalRecalls. Here is how to request a feature:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Email <a href="mailto:support@totalrecalls.app">support@totalrecalls.app</a> with your suggestion.</li>
    <li>Open a GitHub Issue at <a href="https://github.com/breakwater2026/TotalRecalls">breakwater2026/TotalRecalls</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We review all requests and track the most popular ones on our <a href="/roadmap/">roadmap</a>.</p>
</BaseLayout>
